  question: Will Jesus come to die on the cross again when He comes back?
  answers:
  - No way!
  - Depends on how things work out
  - He has too
  - Only if He wants to
  correctAnswerIndex: 0
  discussionAnswer: Jesus died on the cross at His first coming to pay for the sins
    of His people. There is no other sacrifice needed for His people.
